DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a night of reggae music and high times with Asheville’s Tuff Sol which features Jake Burns and Buffalo Brown on Guitar/Vocals\, Roddy Wilder on Bass/Vocals\, Taylor Pierson on Keys & Jonathan Lloyd on Drums/Vocals! \nShiloh & Gaines – Your neighborhood bar……no matter where you live. \nCoffee ~ Spirits ~ Pool ~ Darts ~ Live Music ~ Dog Friendly ~ Karaoke & More! Find our music schedule and more at shilohandgaines.com
