SUMMARY:Pickety Split
DESCRIPTION:Based in Charlotte\, North Carolina\, Pickety Split is a lively acoustic band led by multi-instrumentalist and songwriter Cooper Eades. They offer a fresh take on traditional bluegrass\, blending classic standards with jamgrass-infused originals. Known for their unique perspective in the acoustic realm\, they bring high-energy performances to audiences across the Southeast.\n\nhttps://picketysplitmusic.com/\n\n$5 Cover\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/pickety-split-2/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/670343902_1613564526588989_8858706952684372862_n-e1776447387172.jpg
