SUMMARY:More Sunday Electronic/DJ's
DESCRIPTION:Although we are primarily a Live Music Calendar\, we often come across Electronic & DJ events in the area and list them for you as we find out about them. Please verify the DJ\, times and cover charges with the venue. \nCooperative Coffee Roasters – 10am-2pm \nEda’s Hideaway Weaverville – 11am-5pm \nVisuals Rooftop – 2-5pm \nHighland Brewing Rooftop – 5-8pm \nFleetwoods – 8:30pm-12am \nCheck with the venue on tonight’s DJs and cover charges.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/more-sunday-electronic-dj-events/
LOCATION:Asheville Area
